{"t":"Edron Graveyard","s":"edron-graveyard-6cfa6","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Edron_Graveyard_0f765c.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> Graveyard is located north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33315,31734,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33315, 31734, 7)</a>. One of the few graveyards only accessible by Premium players. There is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawn</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Grave%20Flower\">Grave Flowers</a> . There are twenty graves and a crypt with a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin\">Stone Coffin</a>. A single <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeleton</a> spawns in the crypt, and a few more in a hole north of the gaveyard.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"2bdbeb1707bfbf725510e042d33fa4ec\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Edron_Graveyard-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Edron_Graveyard_0f765c.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Edron Graveyard.png (278 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"32pxd\"><img alt=\"32pxd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><figcaption>32pxd</figcaption></figure><p><i>This  article is a stub. You can help TibiaWiki by expanding it.</i></p></div></div>","quests":["research-and-development-quest"]}